BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:chios-elata-boat-panigiri-of-agios-stefanos-islet-elata-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270801
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270803
SUMMARY:Boat panigiri of Agios Stefanos islet\, Elata
LOCATION:Elata\, Chios\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:For the feast of St Stephen's relics (2 August) the mastic village of Elata celebrates on the islet of Agios Stefanos off Agia Irini bay: boats leave the little harbour of Agia Irini around 18:00 on the eve for vespers and a gathering at the chapel. Small\, unusual and weather-dependent\; bring water and something for the boatman.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chios/#elata-boat-panigiri-of-agios-stefanos-islet-elata
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chios/#elata-boat-panigiri-of-agios-stefanos-islet-elata
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ikaria-dafni-panigiri-of-the-seven-youths-of-ephesus-dafni-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270804
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270805
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Seven Youths of Ephesus\, Dafni
LOCATION:Dafni\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Dafni\, a small mountain village inland from Evdilos\, celebrates on 4 August with a panigiri organised by its cultural association: roast goat\, mezedes and Ikarian wine\, with Nikos Fakaros's orchestra in 2025. Two days later the same village keeps the Transfiguration (6 August) alongside Christos Raches\, Frantato and Stavlos\, so it is a good base for a three-night run.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#dafni-panigiri-of-the-seven-youths-of-ephesus-dafni
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#dafni-panigiri-of-the-seven-youths-of-ephesus-dafni
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:amorgos-chora-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-chora-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration (Sotiros)\, Chora
LOCATION:Chora\, Amorgos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Chora's own feast\, held by the Simonidis association in the Loza square on 5-6 August: after the liturgy the village serves food and wine with live island music and dancing under the plane trees. Smaller than Agia Paraskevi but right in the middle of the prettiest village on the island.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/amorgos/#chora-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-chora
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/amorgos/#chora-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-chora
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:andros-arni-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-arni-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration (Sotiros)\, Arni
LOCATION:Arni\, Andros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Arni\, the highest and greenest village on Andros\, celebrates the Transfiguration with a panigiri on the evening of 5-6 August: froutalia (the Andros potato-and-sausage omelette)\, roast meat\, wine and violins in the square\, organised by the village association with free entry. The road up from Batsi is long and twisty\; allow 40 minutes.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/andros/#arni-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-arni
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/andros/#arni-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-arni
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:chania-xirosterni-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiras-xirostern-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration (Sotiras)\, Xirosterni
LOCATION:Xirosterni\, Crete (Chania)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:A small Apokoronas village with one of the area's most consistent 5–6 August panigiria: Cretan music in the square on the eve\, liturgy and a second glenti on the day itself. Expect boiled goat with pilafi\, local wine and syrtos/pentozalis\; it is a village affair\, so come with cash and no expectations of a menu.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chania/#xirosterni-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiras-xirostern
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chania/#xirosterni-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiras-xirostern
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:corfu-pantokrator-summit-strinilas-six-day-pilgrimage-to-pantokrat-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270811
SUMMARY:Six-day pilgrimage to Pantokrator and Transfiguration feasts
LOCATION:Pantokrator summit / Strinilas\, Corfu\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:From 1 to 6 August pilgrims climb to the monastery on the 906 m summit of Pantokrator for the six days of the Transfiguration\, sleeping in the cells and celebrating the liturgy at dawn on the 6th\; the villages below — Strinilas\, Perivoli\, Spartylas\, Palaiochori in Lefkimmi\, Agios Matthaios — hold their own panigiria on the evening of the 5th or 6th. Strinilas\, the last village before the summit road\, is the one with tavernas and music.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/corfu/#pantokrator-summit-strinilas-six-day-pilgrimage-to-pantokrat
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/corfu/#pantokrator-summit-strinilas-six-day-pilgrimage-to-pantokrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ithaca-stavros-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-stavros-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration\, Stavros
LOCATION:Stavros\, Ithaca\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The longest and largest panigiri on Ithaca\, with more than a century of history: two nights\, 5 and 6 August\, in the central square of Stavros with an orchestra playing continuously\, long tables of grilled meat and wine\, and the whole north of the island dancing. Nothing to book\, but arrive by 9pm on the second night if you want a table.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ithaca/#stavros-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-stavros
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ithaca/#stavros-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-stavros
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:karpathos-othos-panigiri-of-metamorfosi-sotiros-othos-aperi-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Metamorfosi Sotiros\, Othos & Aperi
LOCATION:Othos\, Karpathos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Othos\, the highest village on Karpathos\, and neighbouring Aperi both celebrate the Transfiguration on 5-6 August with vespers\, communal food and dancing to lyra. Go up on the evening of the 5th\; the two villages are five minutes apart\, so you can do both.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/karpathos/#othos-panigiri-of-metamorfosi-sotiros-othos-aperi
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/karpathos/#othos-panigiri-of-metamorfosi-sotiros-othos-aperi
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:meganisi-katomeri-feast-of-the-transfiguration-katomeri-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Feast of the Transfiguration\, Katomeri
LOCATION:Katomeri\, Meganisi\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Transfiguration is kept at the church of the Saviour in Katomeri and at the Faneromeni monastery's dependency on the island\, with vespers on 5 August and liturgy on the 6th attended by the mayor and the monastery's abbot\; a reception follows. It is a church feast more than a party\, but it lands in the busiest week of the year and the tavernas of Katomeri fill afterwards.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/meganisi/#katomeri-feast-of-the-transfiguration-katomeri
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/meganisi/#katomeri-feast-of-the-transfiguration-katomeri
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:naxos-danakos-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-at-fotodotis-danakos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration at Fotodotis\, Danakos
LOCATION:Danakos\, Naxos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The fortified Byzantine monastery of Fotodotis Christos above the tiny village of Danakos celebrates the Transfiguration on 6 August with the Metropolitan's liturgy and the blessing of the first grapes\, and Danakos holds a small\, warm panigiri with food and live music. Local listings also give Danakos a feast for Agios Panteleimon on 27 July\, so ask which night the village is actually cooking. Glinado\, Damarionas and Kourounochori keep Sotiros the same day.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/naxos/#danakos-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-at-fotodotis-danakos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/naxos/#danakos-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-at-fotodotis-danakos
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:paros-marpissa-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-marpissa-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration (Sotiros)\, Marpissa
LOCATION:Marpissa\, Paros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Marpissa's parish church is dedicated to the Transfiguration\, so 5-6 August is the village's own feast: a bishop's liturgy on the day\, and the night before a panigiri in Papa-Giorgis Stamenas square with food\, wine and live island music. Aliki on the south coast holds a smaller Sotiros feast the same evening\, often with a fish festival on the beach. Marpissa's lanes are car-free\; park at the entrance by the main road.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paros/#marpissa-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-marpissa
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paros/#marpissa-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-marpissa
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:patmos-kampos-panigiri-of-christos-transfiguration-kampos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Christos (Transfiguration)\, Kampos
LOCATION:Kampos\, Patmos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The church of Christos in Kato Kampos celebrates the Transfiguration with a vespers on the 5th and a panigiri with music and dance run by the Kampos cultural association 'Evangelistria'\, spilling into the tavernas on Kampos beach. Easy: it is the island's main beach village.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#kampos-panigiri-of-christos-transfiguration-kampos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#kampos-panigiri-of-christos-transfiguration-kampos
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rethymno-myrthios-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiras-myrthios-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration (Sotiras)\, Myrthios
LOCATION:Myrthios\, Crete (Rethymno)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The balcony village above Plakias holds its feast of the Saviour on the evening of 5 August with a Cretan kompania in the square and food from the cultural association. It is the panigiri for anyone staying on the Plakias coast\; the road up is short but parking in Myrthios is scarce\, so walk up from the first bend or take a taxi.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rethymno/#myrthios-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiras-myrthios
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rethymno/#myrthios-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiras-myrthios
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rhodes-fanes-panigiri-of-metamorfosi-sotiros-fanes-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Metamorfosi Sotiros\, Fanes
LOCATION:Fanes\, Rhodes\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Fanes\, on the west coast between Kalavarda and Soroni\, celebrates the Transfiguration with a village panigiri on the evenings of 5 and 6 August: liturgy at the Sotiras church\, then a glendi on the square with local bands\, souvlaki and wine. Neighbouring Maritsa does its own 'Sotiria' the same days\, so you can hop between them. Kiotari in the south also feasts the Saviour on 5-6 August.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rhodes/#fanes-panigiri-of-metamorfosi-sotiros-fanes
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rhodes/#fanes-panigiri-of-metamorfosi-sotiros-fanes
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:samos-pythagoreio-transfiguration-feast-re-enactment-of-the-1824-b-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Transfiguration feast & re-enactment of the 1824 Battle of Samos\, Pythagoreio
LOCATION:Pythagoreio\, Samos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Samos's biggest date: the Transfiguration is also the anniversary of the 1824 naval victory over the Ottomans off Mycale. On the evening of 5 August the icon is carried from the church of the Metamorfosi to the harbour (around 21:00)\, followed at 22:00 by a re-enactment of the sea battle with fireworks and a harbour-front glendi\; on 6 August there is a hierarchical liturgy\, wreath-laying at the Lykourgos Logothetis monument and dance groups in the square. Roads into Pythagoreio close from 17:00 on the 5th\, so park outside town and walk.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/samos/#pythagoreio-transfiguration-feast-re-enactment-of-the-1824-b
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/samos/#pythagoreio-transfiguration-feast-re-enactment-of-the-1824-b
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:santorini-pyrgos-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-pyrgos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration (Sotiros)\, Pyrgos
LOCATION:Pyrgos\, Santorini\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Pyrgos keeps an old custom for the Transfiguration: on the eve the village boys 'steal' basil plants from the girls' courtyards to decorate the dome of the church of Christ\, and after the liturgy on 6 August there is a panigiri in the kastro lanes with wine\, food and music. One of the few Santorini feasts that still feels like a village affair.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/santorini/#pyrgos-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-pyrgos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/santorini/#pyrgos-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-pyrgos
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:serifos-pyrgos-panigiri-of-sotiras-transfiguration-pyrgos-and-kalo-a-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Sotiras (Transfiguration)\, Pyrgos and Kalo Ampeli
LOCATION:Pyrgos\, Serifos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Transfiguration is kept at the village of Pyrgos and at the chapel of Sotiras above Kalo Ampeli beach\, with vespers on the evening of 5 August\, the ktitores' table of fava and goat\, and liturgy on the 6th. Pyrgos is the more accessible of the two and has the village-square glenti\; Kalo Ampeli is a walk-in beach chapel and very quiet.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/serifos/#pyrgos-panigiri-of-sotiras-transfiguration-pyrgos-and-kalo-a
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/serifos/#pyrgos-panigiri-of-sotiras-transfiguration-pyrgos-and-kalo-a
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:skopelos-skopelos-town-panigiri-of-sotiros-transfiguration-skopelos-t-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Sotiros (Transfiguration)\, Skopelos Town and Metamorfosi Monastery
LOCATION:Skopelos Town\, Skopelos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On 5 August the 16th-century monastery of Metamorfosi tou Sotiros above the Chora holds festive vespers with artoklasia at 8 pm\, often with Athonite monks concelebrating\, and the liturgy at 7.30 next morning. On the evening of the 6th the Dimos Skopelou stages the town's big open-air panigiri on the harbour front / KAPI courtyard with a name nisiotika singer (Nasia Konitopoulou in 2025)\, free to attend. Go up to the monastery for the vespers and come down to the port for the dancing.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skopelos/#skopelos-town-panigiri-of-sotiros-transfiguration-skopelos-t
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skopelos/#skopelos-town-panigiri-of-sotiros-transfiguration-skopelos-t
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:symi-nimborio-panigiri-of-sotiris-transfiguration-nimborio-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Sotiris (Transfiguration)\, Nimborio
LOCATION:Nimborio\, Symi\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Transfiguration is kept at Nimborio\, the bay a half-hour walk west of Gialos\, with vespers on the 5th and a feast in the courtyard with fried fish\, salads and wine\, and Symiot music\; it is also the 'Ag. Sotiris' night listed within the Symi Festival programme. Walk back along the coast road with a torch\, or take a water taxi.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/symi/#nimborio-panigiri-of-sotiris-transfiguration-nimborio
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/symi/#nimborio-panigiri-of-sotiris-transfiguration-nimborio
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:evia-north-mantoudi-panigiri-of-sotiros-transfiguration-mantoudi-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Sotiros (Transfiguration)\, Mantoudi
LOCATION:Mantoudi\, Evia (North)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Mantoudi's parish church is the Metamorfosi\, and on 6 August the food for the feast is cooked in cauldrons in the churchyard and shared after the liturgy\, with music in the square\; the municipality lists it each summer. A weekday-style village panigiri rather than a concert\, which is the point.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/evia-north/#mantoudi-panigiri-of-sotiros-transfiguration-mantoudi
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/evia-north/#mantoudi-panigiri-of-sotiros-transfiguration-mantoudi
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ikaria-christos-raches-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-chri-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration (Sotiros)\, Christos Raches
LOCATION:Christos Raches\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Christos Rachon throws one of the two biggest panigiria on Ikaria\, for the Transfiguration. The mountain village fills with thousands and the proceeds fund the village all year — school\, roads\, the clinic. The dancing routinely runs until 7am.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#christos-raches-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-chri
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#christos-raches-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-chri
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ikaria-frantato-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-frantato-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration\, Frantato
LOCATION:Frantato\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Frantato\, in the green interior between Evdilos and Raches\, throws its Sotiros panigiri on the evening of 6 August with the Zevkalides band\, the island's best-known young Ikarian ensemble. It is the panigiri locals from the Evdilos side choose over Christos Raches: smaller\, with goat and wine from the village association and dancing until daybreak. Stavlos\, a short drive away\, runs an all-day feast the same date.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#frantato-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-frantato
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#frantato-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-frantato
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kea-poisses-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-poisses-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration\, Poisses
LOCATION:Poisses\, Kea (Tzia)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The west-coast valley of Poisses celebrates its Sotiras church on 6 August from 20:00\, organised by the municipality and the Poisses society 'Agios Isidoros': liturgy\, then food\, wine and live island music by the beach. It's a long drive from the port on the west-coast road — allow 30 minutes and don't rush back in the dark.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kea/#poisses-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-poisses
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kea/#poisses-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-poisses
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kythira-avlemonas-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-avlemonas-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration\, Avlemonas
LOCATION:Avlemonas\, Kythira\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The fishing village of Avlemonas keeps its annual chorós on the evening of 6 August\, feast of the Saviour\, with live music and dancing on the harbour from 9pm and food from the tavernas around it. Small and very pretty\; parking is at the entrance of the village.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythira/#avlemonas-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-avlemonas
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythira/#avlemonas-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-avlemonas
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lasithi-zakros-panigiri-of-afentis-christos-transfiguration-zakros-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Afentis Christos (Transfiguration)\, Zakros
LOCATION:Zakros\, Crete (Lasithi)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Upper Zakros\, the village at the top of the Gorge of the Dead\, celebrates the Saviour on the evening of 6 August with several local musicians and a dinner ticket (15 euros\, 10 for children in 2025). Combine a morning at the Minoan palace and Kato Zakros beach with the glenti in the village square\; the road back to Sitia is an hour of bends.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lasithi/#zakros-panigiri-of-afentis-christos-transfiguration-zakros
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lasithi/#zakros-panigiri-of-afentis-christos-transfiguration-zakros
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lefkada-eglouvi-lentil-festival-at-agios-donatos-eglouvi-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Lentil Festival at Agios Donatos\, Eglouvi
LOCATION:Eglouvi\, Lefkada\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On the feast of the Transfiguration the Eglouvi cultural association cooks the village's famous lentils the old way in cauldrons on the Agios Donatos plateau above the village\, and serves them free with bread\, olives and wine from about 7pm\, followed by live music and dancing under the stars. Parking on the plateau is chaotic\; the association runs a shuttle bus from the old KTEL station in Lefkada town at 6:30pm with a stop at Agios Minas\, which is the sane way up.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#eglouvi-lentil-festival-at-agios-donatos-eglouvi
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#eglouvi-lentil-festival-at-agios-donatos-eglouvi
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lefkada-nikiana-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-nikiana-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration\, Nikiana
LOCATION:Nikiana\, Lefkada\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Nikiana's church of the Saviour celebrates on 6 August with a big open-air panigiri on the seafront the same evening\, booking well-known folk singers and a full orchestra\; food and drink from the village associations\, dancing late. Nikiana is on the east-coast road 10 minutes north of Nydri\, so it is easy to combine with a stay anywhere on that coast.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#nikiana-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-nikiana
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#nikiana-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-nikiana
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lemnos-neo-pedino-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-neo-pedino-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration\, Neo Pedino
LOCATION:Neo Pedino\, Lemnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The cultural association of Pedino celebrates the village church's feast on the evening of 6 August in the square of Neo Pedino\, central Lemnos: free entry\, live music 'until morning'\, food and drink from the association. A typical Lemnian village panigiri\, 15 minutes from Myrina\, and one of the few kept on the saint's day itself rather than the eve.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lemnos/#neo-pedino-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-neo-pedino
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lemnos/#neo-pedino-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-neo-pedino
