DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270823
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270825
SUMMARY:Feast of Agios Dionysios (translation of the relics)\, Zakynthos town
LOCATION:Zakynthos town\, Zakynthos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Patron saint of Zakynthos. Procession of his relics from his church through the streets of Zakynthos town. The August event coincides with peak season\; the December one is for locals.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/zakynthos/#zakynthos-town-feast-of-agios-dionysios-translation-of-the-r
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/zakynthos/#zakynthos-town-feast-of-agios-dionysios-translation-of-the-r
